  "description": "Run Bun, the fast all-in-one JavaScript runtime and bundler, from your .NET build. Bundle and minify JavaScript and TypeScript, compile Sass/SCSS, and install npm dependencies during dotnet build on Windows, Linux and macOS (x64 and ARM64) - no Node.js required. Works with ASP.NET Core, Blazor and Razor Class Library static web assets. Supply the Bun binary with a platform-specific Scarlet.Bun.Runtime package, or let the build download it on demand.",
